<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>Cut the Rope - Level 1</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; user-select: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  html, body { height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden; background: #2a1810; font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', system-ui, sans-serif; touch-action: none; }
  #game { position: relative; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #6b4423 0%, #3d2817 100%); overflow: hidden; }
