## ✅ Usage Examples — call from anywhere

```csharp
// Primitives
SaveManager.Set("playerName", "Hero");
SaveManager.Set("level", 12);
SaveManager.Set("health", 87.5f);
SaveManager.Set("isVip", true);

// Unity types
SaveManager.Set("spawnPos", transform.position);   // Vector3
SaveManager.Set("rotation", transform.rotation);   // Quaternion
SaveManager.Set("uiColor", Color.red);

// Custom class (must be [Serializable])
[Serializable]
public class PlayerStats { public int xp; public int gold; public List<string> items; }

var stats = new PlayerStats { xp = 4200, gold = 99, items = new(){"sword","potion"} };
SaveManager.Set("stats", stats);

// Write to disk
SaveManager.Save();

// --- Later / next session ---
SaveManager.Load();
int level         = SaveManager.Get<int>("level", 1);
Vector3 pos       = SaveManager.Get<Vector3>("spawnPos");
PlayerStats data  = SaveManager.Get<PlayerStats>("stats");

// Utilities
if (SaveManager.Has("level")) { ... }
SaveManager.Delete("uiColor");
SaveManager.DeleteAll();
```

