## ✨ Optional: auto-save on quit
Add a bootstrap component anywhere in your first scene:

```csharp
public class SaveBootstrap : MonoBehaviour
{
    void Awake()              { DontDestroyOnLoad(gameObject); SaveManager.Load(); }
    void OnApplicationQuit()  { SaveManager.Save(); }
    void OnApplicationPause(bool p) { if (p) SaveManager.Save(); } // mobile
}
