## 🔑 Why this is professional
- **No PlayerPrefs** — real file in `persistentDataPath`.
- **AES encrypted** — players can't trivially edit saves.
- **Generic API** — one `Set<T>` / `Get<T>` for everything.
- **Handles Unity types** (Vector/Quaternion/Color) via wrappers.
- **Supports custom classes, lists, arrays, dictionaries** (wrap dictionaries in a serializable class like the DTO pattern).
- **Single source of truth** — static, accessible everywhere.
- **Safe defaults** — corrupted/missing data falls back without crashing.

Change `EncryptKey` to your own 16-character secret before shipping. 🚀

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
